  "body": "- Added an input dialog for template service instances. #66\r\n- Added `--no-notifications` to disable failure notifications. #76\r\n- Fixed the `f` key when the service list is empty. #67\r\n- Expanded the test suite to 125 tests, including real systemd integration coverage.\r\n- Improved overall reliability, performance, error handling, terminal restoration, and packaging."
